Comment: 0,0:00:00.94,0:00:03.11,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,Swaying light, falling, trembling bright
Comment: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.40,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,Colors all around me, blooming wild and free
Comment: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:09.57,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,In the town of flowers, I remember you
Comment: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:12.24,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,From this endless sky
Comment: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:22.75,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,From a chance surprise that came my way
Comment: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:25.55,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,Here I found this place I know
Comment: 0,0:00:26.55,0:00:28.63,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,Far across the lands I dreamed
Comment: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:31.68,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,Shining bright, stages all aglow
Comment: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:38.94,Translate,álgido,0,0,0,,Shining so bright it takes my breath, now I know this world is real
Comment: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:44.48,Translate,álgido,0,0,0,,Every challenge before my eyes, I'll meet every time
Comment: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:51.78,Translate,álgido,0,0,0,,Endless surprises, unforeseen, fit perfectly in my hands
Comment: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:58.83,Translate,álgido,0,0,0,,At the road’s end, a new view waits, calling to me
Comment: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:04.63,Translate,álgido,0,0,0,,Back then I could never have dreamed this
Comment: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:07.13,Translate,álgido,0,0,0,,The future now begins before my eyes
Comment: 0,0:01:07.34,0:01:11.72,Translate,álgido,0,0,0,,Days like these aren't so bad after all
Comment: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.02,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,Swaying light, falling, trembling bright
Comment: 0,0:01:20.77,0:01:23.23,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,Colors all around me, blooming wild and free
Comment: 0,0:01:24.15,0:01:26.36,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,In the town of flowers, I remember you
Comment: 0,0:01:26.57,0:01:29.11,Translate,tranquilo,0,0,0,,From this endless sky
